@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token

### Public site identity; only siteName and demoMode are returned
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/site-info
Accept: application/json

### Inspection failures are independent of successful capture acknowledgement
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traceability/records?outcome=Failed&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Historical/unmapped records stay unevaluated after configuration changes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traceability/records?outcome=NotEvaluated&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Daily production entry does not require Configure permission
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/oee/downtimes?confirmed=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
